  33:../../opus/silk/control_SNR.c **** /* These tables hold SNR values divided by 21 (so they fit in 8 bits)
  34:../../opus/silk/control_SNR.c ****    for different target bitrates spaced at 400 bps interval. The first
  35:../../opus/silk/control_SNR.c ****    10 values are omitted (0-4 kb/s) because they're all zeros.
  36:../../opus/silk/control_SNR.c ****    These tables were obtained by running different SNRs through the
  37:../../opus/silk/control_SNR.c ****    encoder and measuring the active bitrate. */
